<title>UK: William Cook says Triplex bid undervalues it.</title>
<headline>William Cook says Triplex bid undervalues it.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>British steel company William Cook Plc said on Friday that Triplex Lloyd Plc's 57.7 million stg cash and stock bid for it was unwelcome and fundamentally undervalued the company.</p>
</text>
